WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:13.098
ANC Presentations now brings the full client story into one working canvas. Start from finished ANC slides, reorder the narrative, and keep every delivery control within reach.

00:13.898 --> 00:25.313
Selective Spatial 3D adds reusable venue assets without commissioning a custom model for every pitch. Choose an approved display surface, add partner artwork, preview it, then apply it as a real slide.

00:26.113 --> 00:35.570
Motion Director gives the presenter seven curated motion styles. Preview each transition on the actual deck, then apply it to one slide or the full presentation.

00:36.370 --> 00:46.949
The DealDeck Agent now operates the builder. Ask for several changes at once; it updates the draft, shows a receipt for each action, and keeps Save or Share behind your confirmation.

00:47.749 --> 01:00.419
Partner Lens reads a prospect website or a logo from the media library. It keeps ANC navigation intact while placing the partner brand only on approved scoreboard, ribbon, and signage surfaces.

01:01.219 --> 01:10.440
Cinematic mode turns the same finished deck into a scroll-driven room experience. Nothing is re-authored, and every chapter, slide, and published detail stays synchronized.

01:11.240 --> 01:23.047
Before sending, run Preflight. Ready to send means the draft you saved, frozen client copy, tracked link, media, desktop and phone rendering, and published PDF have all been proven.

01:24.247 --> 01:34.722
The client receives a premium Decision Room, not a passive file. They can request a revision, ask a question, or approve the next step without leaving the presentation.
